From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 00:14:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Zeppelin F-223A: CMAA2 edge smoothing under Vulkan (hdCMAA,
 default off)

- Intel's CMAA2 (Apache-2.0, LICENSE-CMAA2.txt) compiled from HLSL by glslang (cmaa2_spv.py; colour storage image
  patched to rgba8, R32_UINT working images); five compute passes at BeforeUi, in place on the finished world
- hd/HdVulkanCMAA2: working set shared by the frames, descriptor sets per slot, control buffer zeroed once

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
